text = "Matron lab (her ram fight). Five rams, each target straight below its ram. Her cocoon hangs over one ram's lane, a different one each time: knock it down with that ram, or (round 1) a Goo Bomb on its shadow. Round 2: bait her dive onto a lane's lower end, step off and throw at its target, or stand in her lane while she lies after a dive and step out when she spits: her own ram hits her. She trips rams at you too."
autowrap_mode = 3

